WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.400 --> 00:00:02.400
Open Deep Research from the sidebar.

2
00:00:02.400 --> 00:00:06.600
Ask a specific question. Specific beats broad.

3
00:00:06.600 --> 00:00:08.500
Under Settings, Rounds sets how long it keeps searching; Endpoint and Model pick the model that writes the report.

4
00:00:08.500 --> 00:00:13.100
Click Start. It plans sub-questions, searches through the private SearXNG, reads pages, and writes a report.

5
00:00:13.100 --> 00:00:18.600
Shortened: this run took 1 minute 41 seconds; the wait is shown 19 times faster.

6
00:00:18.600 --> 00:00:20.500
The finished job shows how long it took and how many sources it read.

7
00:00:20.500 --> 00:00:24.900
Click Discuss to open the report in a chat and ask follow-up questions.
